- `fetch.py:450-494` `_status/_header/_integer_header/_close/_response_url` re-implement stdlib response accessors for transport duck-typing.
- `fetch.py:1136`: `os.path.islink(path) or os.path.lexists(path)` — `islink` is subsumed by `lexists`; dead clause.
